{"seq":2,"slug":"unity-of-knowing-and-acting","title":"Unity Of Knowing And Acting","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/unity-of-knowing-and-acting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-doctrine","title":"知行合一","url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/unity-of-knowing-and-acting/the-doctrine","wordCount":1440,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"against-empty-learning","title":"反对空谈之学","url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/unity-of-knowing-and-acting/against-empty-learning","wordCount":1476,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现王阳明最著名的命题\"知行合一\"。它主张知与行本来就是一体的、不可分割的——真知必能行，\"知而不行，只是未知\"。这一命题深刻地纠正了当时知行脱节、知而不行的弊病。与此相联系，王阳明坚决反对脱离实践、空谈心性的\"空谈之学\"，强调\"在事上磨练\"、经世致用。本章揭示王阳明心学知行合一、注重实践的根本精神。\n"}